  "notes": "{繁盛|はんじょう} refers to a prosperous state, especially in business.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {繁盛|はんじょう}する: to prosper, to thrive\n- {商売繁盛|しょうばいはんじょう}: business prosperity\n- {繁盛|はんじょう}している{店|みせ}: thriving shop\n\nCULTURAL NOTE:\n{商売繁盛|しょうばいはんじょう} is a common phrase written on ema (votive tablets) at shrines, praying for business success. {繁盛|はんじょう}{祈願|きがん} (praying for prosperity) is common at New Year.",
